<title>USA: Humana names Murray chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Humana names Murray chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Humana Inc said it has named James Murray as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Murray, who has been serving as interim CFO, succeeds W. Roger Drury, who resigned in July to pursue other career opportunities.</p>
<p>In his role with Humana, Murray will serve as the company's chief financial strategist in its efforts to improve profitability and provide shareholder value.</p>
</text>
